      "text": "North / LargeAppliances / Marketplace / Consumer - week ending 2026-08-09.\n\nrevenue came in -1.8% below forecast (week-on-week move was 1.0%, so most of the headline drop was expected seasonality).\nOrders held roughly steady (-8.2%); cancellations rose from 8.8% to 21.4%. This is a fulfilment problem, not a demand problem.\n\nLikely cause: Logistics vendor switched (3PL contract change) (from 2026-07-27).\n\n2 further action(s) require authority above your level and have been routed to their owners."
